{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54718","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 五十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 五十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出现，便若似（川本作「是」）臙脂。\n荫（辛本作「映」）地满天血如染，此爲天（川本作「大」）杀苦军权，七日雨平川。\n（无雨主火灾。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}